@startuml

salt
{
  <b>CANDIDATE: USD OIS CURVE (USD.RATES.OIS.3M)</b> | [ Back to curves and surfaces ]
  --
  {#
    Point | Kind | Value | Source | Actor
    . | 3M | feed | 4.120% | synthetic.v1.ops.tick | -
    . | 5Y | ? | 3.880% | ? | ? (no actor on a point)
  }
  [ Refresh points ]
  --
  {
    Key a point | Tenor | ^5Y^ | Value | "3.88"
    Reason | ^Desk mark^
  }
  [ Set manual point ]
  --
  {
    Key a surface point | Expiry | ^1Y^ | Strike | ^(not modelled)^
    Value | "19.8" | Reason | ^Thin smile^
  }
  [ Set manual surface point ]
  --
  {
    Spread overlay | ^Twist^ | Applies to | ^segment 2Y-10Y^
    Shift | "0.0005" | Reason | ^Thin market^
  }
  [ Apply spread overlay ]
  --
  {#
    Corrections | Point | Kind | Reason | Survives a feed write
    . | (none written) | - | - | no precedence rule
  }
  [ Clear manual point ]
  --
  Manual point | survives later feed updates until it is cleared
  Candidate only | not published
  --
  [ Arrange approval ] | [ Leave unpublished ]
}

@enduml
